2026-07-27T07:45:05.0766595Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:45:05.0767261Z i /tmp/RtmpYrmq8K/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:45:05.0767725Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:45:05.0768264Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:45:05.0769135Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:45:05.0769886Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:45:05.0770953Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:45:05.0771853Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:45:05.0999884Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:45:05.1103080Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:45:05.1515677Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:45:05.1671337Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
